    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "c34de39b-5026-468e-95da-1b345548dc35",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Ambassador",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ELEGANT_LLAMA",
        "PublicId": "131590823153",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 72c2abc1-8325-4cf1-91cd-b7f20e98c7c2).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47\r\rYour target is Juan Domingo Siciliano, also known as &quot;The Ambassador&quot;, he&#39;s a middle man for all kinds of illegal business, including whoever contracted Hoffman back in Bangkok.\r\rHe has reluctantly prolonged his stay at Vi&#241;edo Yates in Argentina after finding an explosive strapped to his car, supposedly planted by an assassin in the argentinian borders. The explosive has been retrieved by the local security detail and has been stored away at the main entrance&#39;s security hut.\r\rEliminate Domingo and his assistant Augusto Albarez so we can to freely search his files for a list of clients without interruption. You&#39;ll also have to eliminate Fern&#243;n Castiglione, Domingo&#39;s personal bodyguard, due to the high security of the vineyard it&#39;s possible that Fern&#243;n has been assigned to guard duty so expect him to be far away from the target and the party.\r\rGood luck 47, I&#180;ll leave you to prepare.",
        "GameVersion": "8.19.0.72",
